abstract: >
  The TrustSurface Framework provides a structured model for identifying,
  assessing, and governing digital trust across systems, services, and
  organisational dependencies. Version 1.2 separates Trust Signals from
  Evidence as distinct concepts while preserving the framework's domains,
  lifecycle, scorecard, and governance structure.
